# ClubSpark Internal Staff Portal — DO NOT fill this in by hand.
#
# `.env.local` for this portal is generated from the repository root, exactly like
# the 15 services:
#
#     cp .env.example .env      # once, at the repo root
#     npm run setup:env         # generates services/*/.env AND the three portals
#     npm run check:env         # verifies they are present and current
#
# This portal is staff-only and drives the cross-tenant admin plane: staff
# impersonation, per-tenant feature flags, account administration and the audit
# trail. Generating it is what keeps INTERNAL_SECRET byte-identical to the
# services — admin-service's guard is fail-closed, so a mismatch produces a silent
# 401 on every internal call rather than a useful error, and a committed default
# would hand that plane to anyone who used it.
#
# Values it receives, all from the root .env:
#
#   INTERNAL_SECRET               shared with all 15 services
#   NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL      staff sign-in
#   NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY staff sign-in
#   ADMIN_SERVICE_URL             derived from the port table in run-all.sh
